"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                 
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>И железная
вздрогнет
соха,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
