mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Я один не
теряю
спокойства,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Cm</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>III</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>)<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Я один не
пру против
рожна.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Мне не
нужно не
пушек ни
войска,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
